<hr data-start="3897" data-end="3900">
<h3 data-start="3902" data-end="3942">5. Orders of Nature and Joint-Points</h3>
<ul data-start="3943" data-end="4751">
<li data-start="3943" data-end="3995">
<p data-start="3945" data-end="3995"><strong data-start="3945" data-end="3957">Current:</strong> Lists five orders but very briefly.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3996" data-end="4751">
<p data-start="3998" data-end="4021"><strong data-start="3998" data-end="4019">Needed Expansion:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="4024" data-end="4751">
<li data-start="4024" data-end="4337">
<p data-start="4026" data-end="4067">Give each order a <strong data-start="4044" data-end="4064">formal signature</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="4072" data-end="4337">
<li data-start="4072" data-end="4137">
<p data-start="4074" data-end="4137">Physical: <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>F</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi mathvariant="script">L</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(E, F, \mathcal{L})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">F</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal">L</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> with equations of motion.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4142" data-end="4185">
<p data-start="4144" data-end="4185">Material: Chemical potential equations.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4190" data-end="4226">
<p data-start="4192" data-end="4226">Biological: Replicator dynamics.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4231" data-end="4266">
<p data-start="4233" data-end="4266">Mental: Neural field equations.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4271" data-end="4337">
<p data-start="4273" data-end="4337">Cultural: Symbolic interaction modeled as stochastic grammars.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="4340" data-end="4603">
<p data-start="4342" data-end="4404"><strong data-start="4342" data-end="4372">Characteristic timescales:</strong> Insert explicit values, e.g.,</p>
<ul data-start="4409" data-end="4603">
<li data-start="4409" data-end="4447">
<p data-start="4411" data-end="4447">Chemistry: <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^{-9} \, \text{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8141em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">0</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8141em;"><span style="top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">−</span><span class="mord mtight">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">s</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="4452" data-end="4488">
<p data-start="4454" data-end="4488">Neurons: <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^{-3} \, \text{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8141em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">0</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8141em;"><span style="top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">−</span><span class="mord mtight">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">s</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="4493" data-end="4603">
<p data-start="4495" data-end="4603">Conscious perception: <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^{-1} \, \text{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8141em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">0</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8141em;"><span style="top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">−</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">s</span></span></span></span></span>.<br data-start="4541" data-end="4544">
Represent with scaling hierarchy diagrams (in prose).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="4606" data-end="4751">
<p data-start="4608" data-end="4686">Show causal emergence quantitatively with Erik Hoel’s effective information:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">EI = I(Macro \to Macro) - I(Micro \to Micro)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07847em;">I</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07847em;">I</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span><span class="mord mathnormal">a</span><span class="mord mathnormal">cro</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span><span class="mord mathnormal">a</span><span class="mord mathnormal">cro</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07847em;">I</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span><span class="mord mathnormal">cro</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span><span class="mord mathnormal">cro</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
