<p data-start="6634" data-end="6795"><strong data-start="6634" data-end="6666">Computational architectures:</strong> Each alternative (dataflow, associative memory, stack machines, neuromorphic) should have a <strong data-start="6759" data-end="6777">worked example</strong> with equations.</p>
