</li>
<li data-start="2046" data-end="2343">
<p data-start="2049" data-end="2169"><strong data-start="2049" data-end="2076">Biological Order (Life)</strong><br data-start="2076" data-end="2079">
Autopoietic systems maintain low entropy via recursive regulation. Teleonomy emerges:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mtext>org</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∇</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mtext>org</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mtext>org</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{d}{dt}\Phi_{\text{org}} = -\nabla \cdot (\Phi_{\text{org}}\mathbf{v}) + \beta(\Phi_{\text{org}} - \Phi^*),</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 2.0574em; vertical-align: -0.686em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.3714em;"><span style="top: -2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">d</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span></span></span><span style="top: -3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width: 0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top: -3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">d</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Φ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="