<li data-start="877" data-end="1081">
<p data-start="880" data-end="1015"><strong data-start="880" data-end="919">Material Order (Chemistry, Geology)</strong><br data-start="919" data-end="922">
Stabilized by entropy thresholds creating persistent molecular and geological complexes.</p>
